# TwoToe configuration. Only TWOTOE_* settings belong here, never secrets.
# TWOTOE_MODEL is the only environment variable TwoToe reads (docs/DECISIONS.md).
# Everything else (roots, region, telemetry) lives in ~/.twotoe/config.json.

# Local Ollama model tag. Cloud tags are refused.
TWOTOE_MODEL=gemma4:e4b
